# 17. NEXT.JS RULES

Use Next.js App Router best practices.

Prefer Server Components wherever possible.

Whenever a component uses:

```text
useState
useEffect
useContext
useReducer
browser APIs
client-side event handling
```

add:

```text
"use client";
```

at the very top of the file.

Never use client-only functionality incorrectly inside Server Components.

---

# 18. HYDRATION SAFETY

Never create hydration mismatches.

Avoid:

```text
Warning: Extra attributes from the server: %s%s "class,style"
```

Be particularly careful with:

* Themes
* Browser APIs
* Dynamic values
* Authentication state
* Client/server conditional rendering
* DOM manipulation

Ensure server and client markup remain consistent.

